<title>USA: Grant Geophysical returns to California.</title>
<headline>Grant Geophysical returns to California.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grant Geophysical Inc said Friday Enron Oil &amp; Gas Co contracted for a 3-D seismic acquisition crew to conduct a large project in the San Joaquin Basin of California, marking the return of Grant operations within the onshore California exploration market after an absence of several years.</p>
<p>Grant said it will start the 3-D survey in November and the project is expected to be completed in February or March, 1997. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
